<title>DENMARK: Great Belt raises four pct bond offer to 2 bln DKK.</title>
<headline>Great Belt raises four pct bond offer to 2 bln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Great Belt bridge and tunnel consortium on Tuesday raised an existing 1.7 billion crown, four-percent, seven-year bond offer to two billion crowns, lead manager Unidanmark said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It said the offer would be effective from December 6.</p>
<p>The bond matures in 2003 and is already listed on the Copenhagen Bourse, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
